From 7a8bd8572bb2060afb0db8082f8898a8d1aa1503 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ari Wilson <ari.wilson@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 21:28:01 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Add a Download CSV link to the staff screen for bookkeepers
 (#1)

Pick a From and To date on the local staff screen and download every
appointment in that range, one row each: date, start, end, groomer,
client, dog, service, price, status. One route on the existing staff
app, GET /export.csv?from=&to=, so nothing new to run.

The file is UTF-8 with a BOM, CRLF and standard CSV quoting so names
with commas, quotes and accents open cleanly in Excel and Google
Sheets. Names starting with = + - @ get a leading apostrophe so a
spreadsheet shows them as text. Prices are the service's current
price; Fernhill does not store what was charged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
